{"title":"Career roadmap · Quality Analyst","role":"Quality Analyst","summary":"A Quality Analyst in Genetic Engineering and biotechnology evaluates whether biological products, laboratory processes, genetic-engineering workflows and associated data meet defined quality, safety, accuracy and regulatory requirements.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role can span molecular biology, DNA/RNA analysis, cell culture, assay validation, laboratory quality systems, GMP/GLP, documentation, deviation investigation and data integrity."},{"type":"note","label":"Career-route check","text":"This is a directly accessible career path, although employers may use titles such as Quality Analyst, QC Analyst, Quality Control Associate, QA Associate, Molecular Biology QC Analyst or Quality Assurance Executive. More senior QA/QC positions generally require laboratory/industry experience and knowledge of regulated quality systems."},{"type":"note","label":"Timeline assumption","text":"4-year B.Tech/B.E. starting in 2026 → graduation around 2030."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build molecular biology, genetics, analytical testing, statistics and laboratory-quality fundamentals."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work in QC/QA laboratories, assay testing, documentation, validation and regulated biotechnology environments."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Quality Analyst, QC/QA Specialist, Validation Specialist or Quality Systems Lead."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward QA/QC Manager, Quality Systems Manager, Compliance Lead, Validation Manager or biotech quality leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Biology, chemistry, mathematics and programming"},{"text":"MIT OpenCourseWare","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/"},{"text":"Biology/data-analysis project"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Cell biology, genetics and biochemistry"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Genetics/lab-report portfolio"},{"text":"Biological knowledge"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Molecular biology, DNA/RNA and genetic engineering"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"PCR/DNA-analysis case study"},{"text":"Molecular skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Microbiology, recombinant DNA and analytical techniques"},{"text":"NPTEL + laboratory practice"},{"text":"Molecular-analysis project"},{"text":"Laboratory capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Quality control, analytical validation and statistics"},{"text":"FDA Biologics","url":"https://www.fda.gov/vaccines-blood-biologics"},{"text":"Assay-validation report"},{"text":"Quality capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"GMP, GLP, documentation, deviations and CAPA"},{"text":"WHO","url":"https://www.who.int/teams/regulation-prequalification/regulation-and-safety/pharmaceuticals-and-health-products"},{"text":"Mock GMP/QMS documentation"},{"text":"Regulatory readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Data integrity, method validation and quality systems"},{"text":"ICH","url":"https://www.ich.org/"},{"text":"QC/QA internship + validation project"},{"text":"Industry readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Major quality/genetics project + placement preparation"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Final project + quality portfolio"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering Mathematics"},{"text":"General Biology"},{"text":"Cell Biology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Molecular Biology"}